{"nodes": [{"id": "_planning_phases_04_durable_generation_and_accepted_quality_04_research_document", "label": "04-RESEARCH.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".planning/phases/04-durable-generation-and-accepted-quality/04-RESEARCH.md", "source_location": "$graphify-root$/.planning/phases/04-durable-generation-and-accepted-quality/04-RESEARCH.md:1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "document_context": "Historical planning or evidence; claims are source assertions, not independently verified current runtime facts.", "rationale": [{"text": "| AI SDK | `ai` `^7.0.64` | Structured multimodal quality reviewer | Existing reviewer only; keep it behind a stable local analyzer interface because video APIs are experimental. [VERIFIED: apps/worker/package.json] [CITED: https://ai-sdk.dev/docs/reference/ai-sdk-core/generate-video] |", "source_location": "$graphify-root$/.planning/phases/04-durable-generation-and-accepted-quality/04-RESEARCH.md:124"}, {"text": "**Implementation rule:** A post-acceptance operation remains economically live while it is reconcilable. Do not release value just because a caller timed out, the browser closed, or the first output URL could not be downloaded. [VERIFIED: apps/api/src/generation-service.ts:944-1025]", "source_location": "$graphify-root$/.planning/phases/04-durable-generation-and-accepted-quality/04-RESEARCH.md:226"}, {"text": "**What goes wrong:** A visual reviewer returns partial/free-form data and the candidate is accepted because a score looks high.", "source_location": "$graphify-root$/.planning/phases/04-durable-generation-and-accepted-quality/04-RESEARCH.md:273"}, {"text": "**Deprecated/outdated:** Treating generic AI SDK behavior as a stable production protocol is unsafe because `experimental_generateVideo` is explicitly experimental. Keep its changing wire behavior inside `vercel-gateway-seedance.ts` and prove it with a live canary. [CITED: https://ai-sdk.dev/docs/reference/ai-sdk-core/generate-video]", "source_location": "$graphify-root$/.planning/phases/04-durable-generation-and-accepted-quality/04-RESEARCH.md:355"}]}, {"id": "_planning_phases_04_durable_generation_and_accepted_quality_04_research_vercel_ai_gateway", "label": "Vercel AI Gateway", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".planning/phases/04-durable-generation-and-accepted-quality/04-RESEARCH.md", "source_location": "$graphify-root$/.planning/phases/04-durable-generation-and-accepted-quality/04-RESEARCH.md:5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_planning_phases_04_durable_generation_and_accepted_quality_04_research_seedance_2_5", "label": "Seedance 2.5", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".planning/phases/04-durable-generation-and-accepted-quality/04-RESEARCH.md", "source_location": "$graphify-root$/.planning/phases/04-durable-generation-and-accepted-quality/04-RESEARCH.md:13", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_planning_phases_04_durable_generation_and_accepted_quality_04_research_seedance_1_0_local_testing", "label": "Seedance 1.0 local testing", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".planning/phases/04-durable-generation-and-accepted-quality/04-RESEARCH.md", "source_location": "$graphify-root$/.planning/phases/04-durable-generation-and-accepted-quality/04-RESEARCH.md:14", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_planning_phases_04_durable_generation_and_accepted_quality_04_research_gemini_omni_flash", "label": "Gemini Omni Flash", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".planning/phases/04-durable-generation-and-accepted-quality/04-RESEARCH.md", "source_location": "$graphify-root$/.planning/phases/04-durable-generation-and-accepted-quality/04-RESEARCH.md:15", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_planning_phases_04_durable_generation_and_accepted_quality_04_resear